---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: 归档
css:
  - pages/archive
description: 按年月归档
permalink: /archive/
---

{% set postsByYear = collections.posts | groupPostsByYear %}

<h1 class="title">归档</h1>

{% if postsByYear | length %}
  {% for year, posts in postsByYear %}
  <section class="archive-year">
    <h2>{{ year }}</h2>
    <ul class="archive-list">
      {% for post in posts %}
      <li>
        <time>{{ post.data.date | dateFormat }}</time>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}
{% else %}
  <div class="empty-state">
    <p>还没有文章可以归档。</p>
    <p>发布第一篇文章后，这里会按年份自动分组。</p>
  </div>
{% endif %}